No, we were serious.  Your original post just said "I'm starting to 
really hate this game.  All it does is aggravate me."  Without any 
deeper criticism, I was forced to assume you were disgruntled and not 
enjoying yourself.  It's just a game--don't play it if you think it 
to be so poorly made.

Of course, suggestions for feature changes, etc., are welcome here.  
Nethack is an extremely difficult game and those of a certain 
temperament seem to enjoy it more than others.  My girlfriend enjoys 
many games but gave up in disgust after several days of hacking.  
I've seen others lose their jobs (well, ok, one guy) because they 
were so hopelessly addicted.  Many suggestions have been made for how 
the game could be made more fair or even easier.  There's also the 
wizard mode...  It's not absolutely necessary to read all the 
spoilers to get anywhere.  I haven't yet ascended on 3.1, but I'm 
going to try until I do, and I'll skip spoilers as long as possible.

